## Transaction Pattern

```
[e.g. Use prisma.$transaction([...operations]) for atomic multi-step writes]
[e.g. Use prisma.$transaction(async (tx) => { ... }) for complex transactions with control flow]
[e.g. Pass the transaction client (tx) to all operations inside the callback]
```

