## DTO Conventions

- Every request body: DTO class with `@IsString()`, `@IsEnum()`, etc. validators
- Every query param: DTO with `@IsOptional()` where appropriate
- Global `ValidationPipe` with `whitelist: true, forbidNonWhitelisted: true` is configured in `main.ts`
- `@Transform()` for type coercion (query params arrive as strings)
- Response DTOs: use `@Expose()` and `excludeExtraneousValues: true` to prevent data leaks

---

## Error Handling

Use framework exceptions only. Never throw raw `Error`.

| Situation | Exception |
|---|---|
| Record not found | `NotFoundException` |
| Not authenticated | `UnauthorizedException` |
| Wrong role/permission | `ForbiddenException` |
| Bad input | `BadRequestException` |
| Duplicate/conflict | `ConflictException` |

