## Security Baseline (non-negotiable per route)

- [ ] Route has auth guard (or `@Public()` explicitly applied)
- [ ] Permission check present if resource is role-gated
- [ ] Ownership check present if resource belongs to a specific user
- [ ] Request body validated through DTO
- [ ] Response excludes sensitive fields (passwords, tokens, internal IDs)
- [ ] Multi-step writes wrapped in transactions
- [ ] List queries are paginated

